Material Design Icons
=====================

The SVG icons in this directory are derived from Material Design Icons
by Pictogrammers (https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign).

License: Apache 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign/blob/master/LICENSE

Each icon is a single glyph path extracted from the Material Design Icons
set and rewritten as a minimal, monochrome, 24x24 viewBox SVG for use with
CSS mask-image. Color is supplied by the theme's own CSS custom properties;
the source glyph artwork is unmodified in shape.

No endorsement by the Material Design Icons project is implied.
